// the vrtuaal hardware display layers are:
// Background
// Level
// Sprite
// HUD
// this allows us to fuck with the background
// seperately than the level, giving more depth
// even tho everything will be flat rendered and
// shadows are in-texture hard-coded
// we can achieve effects like the angel island
// falling (changing background) thile the level
// is intact and playable

